 "remarks": "Renovated spacious, private and commutable dream home is here! On the outside, you will find your own paved 3 car driveway complete with privacy fence and a low maintenance outdoor area that is perfect for a pet relief area. Outdoor area is also equipped with RING spotlight camera and front doorbell! Upon entering the downstairs, you' ll be greeted by the massive brand new kitchen sporting an 8 foot island that can seat 5 comfortably and new Samsung appliances; making this kitchen fit for any chef! The flexibility of the downstairs allows prospective tenants to configure a possible bedroom/dinning/living room set up in any fashion they desire. The downstairs is complete with a large walk in full pantry / laundry room and full bathroom. Up the freshly carpeted stairs you will find three more bright generous bedrooms and a second full bath. There is no lack of storage at this home with a large basement and pull-down attic. This home's private, comfortable living with a low maintenance lifestyle awaits you! Solar system keeps electrical costs significantly reduced at an additional fixed price of $65 per month on top of rent. Pets required to meet and be approved by landlord. Possible pet fee / pet deposit. Ask Landlord.  STRONG APPLICANTS ONLY: 700+ CREDIT, proof of employment, eviction check, background check, references by a 3rd party of all applicants is required.",
